# The negative: a Kadabra that only evolves by trade, handed a rare candy.
#
# It levels and it stays a Kadabra, because EVO_TRADE is the only entry it has
# and nothing a solo player can do reaches it. The run prints the species it
# WOULD become if it were traded, so the pin says "the evolution exists and the
# game refuses it" rather than the weaker "nothing happened".

name TRADER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20303
money 3000
party SPECIES_KADABRA 20 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_RARE_CANDY 1
map MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN 0x236 0x291 FACE_DOWN
